# AIF portal agent

This repo is the **Wealth Discovery AIF Client Portal**. Implement what the user asks. Hindi, Hinglish, or English all mean a real code change unless they only asked a question.

## Layout

- `aif-front` — Next.js 16 App Router, http://localhost:3000
- `aif-back` — Express 5 ESM (`tsx`), http://localhost:8089
- Keep front and back **fully separate**. Duplicate types and validation. Never import across folders.
- Brand: app “AIF Client Portal”, display “Wealth Discovery Capital”. Logo: `aif-front/public/company.png`.
- Company: Express Tower, Sector 62, Noida, UP 201301; `info@wealthdiscovery.in`; `91 11 4344 4666`. Do not invent a SEBI number.

## Do

- Change code. Do not stop at advice when they asked for a UI or API change.
- Match existing files, labels, and colors. Do not invent a second design system.
- Treat “simple rakho / beautify” as white cards, small sidebar-tone icons, no rainbow panels.
- Copy **layout**, not sample content from mockups.

## Do not

- Commit or push unless they asked.
- Print Mongo URI / passwords.
- Restart `aif-back` for frontend-only work. API is not always on file watch; restart it only after `aif-back` changes.
- Merge “Trading code” (profile) with “Trading Code” / `dpOrderId` (bank). They are different fields.
- Build schedule-delivery as real cron/email unless they ask. It is a recorded request only.

PowerShell has no `&&`. Use separate commands. `$PID` is read-only.
